"An optional \\f[I]SELECTOR\\f[R] in the form of tag=pattern can be provided "
"to narrow the selection, for example name=\\[dq]b*\\[dq] to query packages "
"whose name starts with \\[dq]b\\[dq].\\fR"
msgstr ""

