"aliases it\\[aq]s impossible to guarantee that what\\[aq]s described in the "
"manual matches what\\[aq]s available.\\fR"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
